      "section": "4. Install the transfer roller .",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.0,
        "t": 732.29,
        "r": 546.2299600000003,
        "b": 696.7
      },
      "content": "Place the left (shaft) end of the roller in the retainer clip (callout 1), lower the right end (with the clip) into place making sure that the clip and spring are aligned (callout 2), and then push down (callout 3) on the clip until it snaps in place."
    },
